{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名有長期病患的7歲女童感染流感，臨床診斷為甲型流感併發敗血性休克，目前情况危殆。</p><p>衛生防護中心表示，自今年6月下旬進入流感季節，共錄得28宗兒童感染流感的嚴重個案。</p><p>當中20宗已康復出院、兩宗情况穩定、4宗情况危殆及兩宗死亡。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.969483+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:39:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.871918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.050727+00:00","content_hash":"95b929d4d2f56ff17f95aa9f1b0e332a2fc29d910b897bb28b4edfbeae4725a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}